  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen clicking on the Groups in someones profile there is now a section for mutual groups, which is great! The problem is though that you will see all the Mutual Groups listed again in the \"All Groups\" list below.\n\nThis a few downsides:\n\n- it takes up more UI space\n\n- it can be quite confusing to see a few groups twice\n\n- since the ordering is different it can be even more confusing\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThere should be two sections when looking at someones Groups, \"Mutual Groups\" and \"Other Groups\".\n\nMutual Groups would as it already does only show Groups you have in common with them. Other Groups would list all the Groups that you don't have in common with them.\n\nThis would provide a few benefits:\n\n- it takes up less UI space\n\n- it would be less confusing due to each group only being listed once\n\n- it makes it easier to only see Groups that you **haven't** joined yet \n\n \n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/rvef2n.mp4",
